@startuml
title JoySong Ubuntu 24.04 UAT Full-chain Deployment

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Developer
actor "UAT Reviewer" as Reviewer

rectangle GitHub {
  component "PR / master\nRequired quality gates\nGitHub-hosted Runner" as Quality
  component "UAT tag build\nBackend + Admin\nGitHub-hosted Runner" as Build
  artifact "Actions Artifact\njoysong-uat-<tag>.tar.gz\nmanifest / SHA / SBOM / scan" as Artifact
  component "Publish result\nGitHub-hosted job\nGH_REPO = github.repository" as Publish
  artifact "Private Draft Release" as Draft
  component "Acceptance Issue\nno mobile checklist" as Issue
}

cloud "Alibaba Cloud" {
  node "Fresh ECS\ni-bp19abm7697mvhl0xewu\nUbuntu 24.04.4 / x86_64 / systemd 255" as ECS {
    component "Ubuntu bootstrap\npreflight (read-only) / apply" as Bootstrap
    component "Dedicated Runner v2.337.0\njoysong-gh-runner\nlabel: joysong-uat-deploy only" as Runner
    folder "/var/lib/joysong-deploy\nincoming / state / backups" as DeployData
    component "root-owned fixed entry\n/usr/local/sbin/joysong-uat-deploy" as RootDeploy
    folder "Backend releases\n/opt/joysong-demo\ncurrent / previous" as BackendReleases
    folder "Admin releases\n/var/www/joysong-demo\ncurrent / previous" as AdminReleases
    component "joysong-demo.service\ndemo / 127.0.0.1:8080" as Service
    component "Nginx\nwww-data\n/etc/nginx/conf.d/joysong-public.conf" as Nginx
    file "/etc/joysong-demo/host-contract\ntwo template SHA-256 values" as HostContract
    database "Local MySQL 8\nmyapp_worktree_uat\nfresh: empty\nhealthy: B33 + V34...V40" as Database
    folder "uploads / private / staging\nRunner isolated" as PersistentData
  }

  storage "Existing business Buckets\nACL and objects unchanged" as BusinessBuckets
}

Developer --> Quality : pull request / master push
Quality --> Build : unused UAT tag\npoints to passed master commit
Build --> Artifact : immutable package
Artifact --> Runner : download current run only
Runner --> DeployData : write incoming/<run-id>
Runner --> RootDeploy : sudo fixed argv only

Bootstrap --> Runner : verified archive/version\ncopy bin/runsvc.sh to root (0755)\nhidden PTY token; no argv/env/log
Bootstrap --> RootDeploy : install script, verifier, sudoers
Bootstrap --> Service : install unit; keep inactive/disabled
Bootstrap --> Nginx : install template
Bootstrap --> HostContract : bind systemd + Nginx templates
Bootstrap --> Database : create empty database + least privilege accounts
Bootstrap --> DeployData : create isolated directories

RootDeploy --> DeployData : lock, transaction marker,\nverified backup and identity\nroot-only temporary mysqldump options
RootDeploy --> BackendReleases : verify and install immutable release
RootDeploy --> AdminReleases : verify and install immutable release
RootDeploy --> Service : start / stop / enable
Service --> Database : fresh migration or unchanged existing history
Service --> PersistentData
Service --> BusinessBuckets : application identity only
Nginx --> Service : 127.0.0.1:8080 upstream
Nginx --> AdminReleases : current root

RootDeploy --> BackendReleases : fresh current or atomic existing switch
RootDeploy --> AdminReleases : switch only after Backend health
RootDeploy --> Service : health, MainPID and JAR verification

RootDeploy --> Runner : exit status and non-secret evidence only
Runner --> Publish : successful deploy job unlocks publish
Publish --> Draft
Publish --> Issue
Reviewer --> Issue : later public and business acceptance

note right of Bootstrap
  preflight expects a blank host and is read-only.
  TCP: SSH + identity-verified loopback resolved DNS only.
  apply consumes exactly three root-only secret files.
  Re-apply verifies an identical pre-release installation.
  Unknown or drifting state fails closed.
end note

note right of Runner
  Registered with --no-default-labels and --disableupdate.
  Re-apply verifies repository/name/work identity.
  No cloud or application secrets.
  Cannot read private/staging/state/backups.
  Cannot reach ECS metadata (100.100.100.200).
  Startup guard: app IMDSv2 OK before/after Runner deny.
  Guard runs in Runner cgroup; app control uses separate service.
  PR workflows never use this Runner.
end note

note bottom of RootDeploy
  fresh: no previous; empty Flyway may become B33 + V34...V40.
  fresh requires initial admin credentials; existing forbids ADMIN_PASSWORD.
  existing: migration digest must match; max downtime is 180 seconds.
  Any unexpected Flyway change keeps the service stopped
  with the transaction marker for manual recovery.
end note

note bottom of Issue
  Deployment result:
  UAT Candidate 已部署，公网未 Ready
  Full-chain completion additionally requires
  ADMIN_PASSWORD removal and restart verification.
end note

note bottom of BusinessBuckets
  Release OSS, Alibaba Cloud OIDC and Cloud Assistant
  are not part of the current UAT path.
end note

@enduml
